t it takes to fall in love.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vx3afWlhfHgDMosovW5SNF0kMkE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Pies the Limit\",\"overview\":\"Abby is forced into a double blind date with a woman she's actually already been with before as Sara and Carolyn's dinner party starts getting very warm in the center but cooling around the edges.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mh5asIdvNKIekecfyLXRfnVql9y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Naming the Baby\",\"overview\":\"After a rigorous one night stand, Abby can't get her high-energy guest lover to leave the apartment. Meanwhile, best pal Sara assumes her girlfriend is cheating on her so she decides to hide out at Abby's for awhile.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iI7asmSV78ftBCjIBSjk5NHK8qw.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bacon and Legs\",\"overview\":\"Sara wakes up on Abby's couch with a love hangover and Abby tries to cheer her up with new girls and greasy brunch.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t7iAghrEtQ1noBeKFhad0MtGudQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Danish Twist\",\"overview\":\"Sara sinks deeper into her breakup confusion at breakfast and starts stuffing herself with donuts. The waitress is pissy with Abby for blowing her off after a weekend fling in the Wisconsin Dells, but seems to forgive her when they cross paths in the restroom.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ppccrXqHbVH9A0hw2KZgkR4KhjD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Love Monkey\",\"overview\":\"While working at the bike shop, Abby reluctantly admits to her friend Eileen that the reason she's feeling antsy and distracted has less to do with romance and more to do with her Mother.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zWlUeTfxWzn8FSAG6831HRnVDhX.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"No Fly Zone\",\"overview\":\"Nosy neighbor Lydia interrupts a sweet early morning in bed for Abby and her long-distance lover Haley with an interrogation about the garbage chute.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fuAfYZgWedJe2UmY8ZnCyeo35Py.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Martini in the Closet\",\"overview\":\"Abby tries to teach Sara how to pick up girls at the lesbian bar but gets distracted by a beautiful stranger. Eileen shows up and overwhelms Sara with beer and flattery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tLI2weHS8aeRMFbNqOAbpPi5R1y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Walk Before You Run\",\"overview\":\"Abby catches up with the Martini woman from the lesbian bar but finds herself suddenly shy as she walks her home. Sara and Eileen drink up a storm as \\\"fun friends\\\" with confusing results the next morning.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2pHaBT9DlOzyP7o4ck664RHWFDx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Icing on the Sponge Cake\",\"overview\":\"While tending bar at a reception with her buddy Stan, Abby can't resist a stunning request from the mother-of-the-bride.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q7C2mDdQP64hQciyl79ONSBnQTo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"How To Travel Light\",\"overview\":\"Abby goes to Danielle's apartment for the first time and is unprepared for some new romantic feelings.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lOTgGBxS2aWum9hbPlQo2uRab1v.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Meatball Test\",\"overview\":\"Bobbie and Lydia make dinner and try real hard not to talk about their open relationship. Meanwhile down the hall, Abby locks herself out of her apartment. In her underwear.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ar6lROXZEW6idODggFIBW2n9PDO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Chicago Free Fall\",\"overview\":\"In the Season One Finale, Detective Lydia tries to ask Abby out on a date but Abby is focused on Danielle, the first woman to ever truly spark Abby's heart, but will it be too late?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPZyPWpynLrzK0jsJj8njEaaNqe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2012-12-02\",\"runtime\":5}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-12-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}